{"id":"NCT07676565","title":"Safety and Efficacy of Adjunct Therapies in Adults With Type 1 Diabetes: Multicenter, Registry Study","official":"Safety and Efficacy of Adjunct Therapies in Adults With Type 1diabetes: Multicenter, Registry Study","summary":"This will be a multicenter registry-based study to evaluate safety and efficacy of GLP-1RA and SGLTi therapies in adjunct to insulin in adults with type 1 diabetes (T1D) over 1 year. This study will enroll participants who have been prescribed adjunct therapy as part of usual care.","conditions":["Type 1 Diabetes"],"interventions":[],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Adults ≥18 years of age\n* Clinical diagnosis of T1D\n* GLP-1RA or SGLTi (SGLT-1 and SGLT-2 inhibitors) drug prescribed by their provider for any indication as part of usual care with use for no more than 1 week\n* Use of CGM and availability of CGM data for 1 month prior to enrollment and expected to be available throughout the study\n* Willing and able to provide informed consent\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* No exclusion criteria other than those not meeting inclusion criteria above","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":300,"start":"2026-03-24","pcd":"2028-04","upd":"2026-10-16","sponsor":"Indiana University","areas":["other"],"central":["Kanchan Bhasin, MBBS, MS · (317)-278-2752 · kanbhas@iu.edu"],"sites":[{"f":"Hoag Memorial Hospital","city":"Newport Beach","pr":"California","zip":"92663","s":"R","lat":33.6189,"lon":-117.929,"c":"Brittany Dennis · 949-764-6896 · Brittany.Dennis@hoag.org"},{"f":"University of California, San Francisco (UCSF)","city":"San Francisco","pr":"California","zip":"94158","s":"R","lat":37.7749,"lon":-122.4194,"c":"Nicole Sears · 628-278-8760 · nicole.sears@ucsf.edu"},{"f":"University of Miami","city":"Miami","pr":"Florida","zip":"33136","s":"R","lat":25.7743,"lon":-80.1937,"c":"Julia Martins de Oliveira · 305-243-3466 · Jmd636@miami.edu"},{"f":"Emo